</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f4bc2a3a-90a7-11f1-a129-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/Taiwanimages.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f4bc2a3a-90a7-11f1-a129-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/Taiwanimages.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">25313372-90a8-11f1-86f9-076e9a7b708c</guid><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 08:34:56 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>台北特约记者 陈筱涵</dc:creator></item><item><category>港台</category><title>赖清德：中国“民促法”是一部国际社会应该团结反制的恶法</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E5%8F%B0/20260804-%E8%B5%96%E6%B8%85%E5%BE%B7-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD-%E6%B0%91%E4%BF%83%E6%B3%95-%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E9%83%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%A5%E5%9B%A2%E7%BB%93%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%81%B6%E6%B3%95</link><description>
