</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1908036c-0e1b-11ea-8a22-005056bfe576/w:1024/p:16x9/beidaihe_train_station.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1908036c-0e1b-11ea-8a22-005056bfe576/w:1024/p:16x9/beidaihe_train_station.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d4130bf2-8fe7-11f1-bfc1-c93f8a2c963c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 10:58:43 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>在华被拘捷克商人面临间谍罪指控 布拉格高院取消周二杨艺明案拘留听证会</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260804-%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%8E%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%98%E6%8D%B7%E5%85%8B%E5%95%86%E4%BA%BA%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E9%97%B4%E8%B0%8D%E7%BD%AA%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%A7-%E5%B8%83%E6%8B%89%E6%A0%BC%E9%AB%98%E9%99%A2%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E5%91%A8%E4%BA%8C%E6%9D%A8%E8%89%BA%E6%98%8E%E6%A1%88%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E5%90%AC%E8%AF%81%E4%BC%9A</link><description>
